{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving 0.6501 validation accuracy and 0.6275 F1, outperforming the pca_n2000 baseline (config_002: 0.5907 accuracy). The results suggest scvi_n200 may offer better performance in multiprofile RNA-only setups, but the role of encoder complexity and potential interactions with aggregation methods remain uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

